# Unlike the repo root's `.gitignore` (`/target`, anchored to the repo
# root), this crate and its two sub-crates (`decoder-asm/`,
# `decoder-noasm/`) are each their own detached `[workspace]` (see this
# directory's `Cargo.toml`), so each has its own `target/` directory below
# this one. Unanchored here so it matches all three.
target/
